<!DOCTYPE html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title><%= title %></title><link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/styles.css"><link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/business.css"></head><body><%- include('../partials/admin_header') %><main class="studio-admin"><% const course=kind==='course-bookings';const parentName=id=>{const parent=parents.find(p=>String(p._id)===String(id));return parent?(parent.name || parent.title):String(id);}; %><h1><%= title %></h1><p><a href="/admin/access-records?kind=<%= kind==='course-bookings'?'courses':'webinars' %>">View access fees, payment status and registrations</a></p><% if(error){ %><p role="status" class="settings-note"><%= error %></p><% } %>
<% if(item){ %><a href="/admin/<%= kind %>">Back to list</a><h2><%= parentName(item[course?'course_id':'webinar_id']) %></h2><dl><% const keys=course?['name','email','whatsapp','preferred_date','preferred_time','mode','experience_level','notes','status','createdAt']:['full_name','email','whatsapp','country','city','profession','experience_level','registration_status','payment_status','attendance_status','amount_paise','currency','razorpay_order_id','razorpay_payment_id','payment_note','createdAt'];keys.forEach(key=>{ %><dt><%= key.replaceAll('_',' ') %></dt><dd><%= item[key] instanceof Date?item[key].toISOString():item[key]??'—' %></dd><% }) %></dl><% if(course){ %><p>Preferred date and time are in IST.</p><form method="post" action="/admin/course-bookings/<%= item._id %>/status" class="studio-form"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= learningCsrf %>"><label>Booking Status<select name="status"><% bookingStatuses.forEach(status=>{ %><option <%= item.status===status?'selected':'' %>><%= status %></option><% }) %></select></label><button type="submit">Update Status</button></form><% }else{ %><div class="studio-actions"><% if(['Confirmed','Attended'].includes(item.registration_status)){ %><form method="post" action="/admin/webinar-registrations/<%= item._id %>/attend"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= learningCsrf %>"><button type="submit">Mark Attended</button></form><% } %><% if(item.razorpay_order_id){ %><form method="post" action="/admin/webinar-registrations/<%= item._id %>/check"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= learningCsrf %>"><button type="submit">Check Gateway Payment Status</button></form><% } %></div><% if(item.order_creating && !item.razorpay_order_id){ %><section class="studio-section"><h2>Recover Payment Order</h2><p>Look up receipt <strong>web_<%= item._id %></strong> in Razorpay. Paste the matching order ID. The server verifies its receipt, registration reference, amount and currency before linking it.</p><form method="post" action="/admin/webinar-registrations/<%= item._id %>/recover-order" class="studio-form"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= learningCsrf %>"><label>Razorpay Order ID<input name="order_id" required maxlength="100"></label><button type="submit">Verify & Link Order</button></form><p>If no matching order exists in Razorpay, wait five minutes after the failed setup before enabling a retry. Do not reset if an order exists; link it above instead.</p><form method="post" action="/admin/webinar-registrations/<%= item._id %>/reset-order" class="studio-form"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= learningCsrf %>"><label><span><input style="width:auto" type="checkbox" name="no_order_acknowledged" required> I checked Razorpay and confirm no order exists for this receipt.</span></label><button type="submit">Allow Payment Setup Retry</button></form></section><% } %><% if(item.registration_status!=='Cancelled'){ %><section class="studio-section"><h2>Cancel Registration</h2><p>Cancellation releases the seat. It does not issue a refund.</p><form method="post" action="/admin/webinar-registrations/<%= item._id %>/cancel" class="studio-form"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= learningCsrf %>"><label><span><input type="checkbox" name="refund_acknowledged" style="width:auto"> I confirm cancellation and will handle any paid refund separately in Razorpay.</span></label><button type="submit">Cancel Registration & Release Seat</button></form></section><% } %><% } %>
<% }else{const params=new URLSearchParams();for(const key of ['q','item','status','payment'])if(typeof query[key]==='string')params.set(key,query[key]); %><form method="get" class="studio-form"><label>Search name, email or WhatsApp<input name="q" maxlength="100" value="<%= typeof query.q==='string'?query.q:'' %>"></label><label><%= course?'Course':'Webinar' %><select name="item"><option value="">All</option><% parents.forEach(parent=>{ %><option value="<%= parent._id %>" <%= String(parent._id)===query.item?'selected':'' %>><%= parent.name || parent.title %></option><% }) %></select></label><label><%= course?'Booking Status':'Payment Status' %><select name="<%= course?'status':'payment' %>"><option value="">All</option><% (course?bookingStatuses:paymentStatuses).forEach(status=>{ %><option <%= query[course?'status':'payment']===status?'selected':'' %>><%= status %></option><% }) %></select></label><button type="submit">Filter</button></form><p><%= total %> records<% if(!course){ %> · <a href="/admin/webinar-registrations/export.csv?<%= params.toString() %>">Export Matching Registrations</a><% } %></p><div class="studio-table"><table><thead><tr><th>Name</th><th>Contact</th><th><%= course?'Course':'Webinar' %></th><th>Status</th><th>Received</th></tr></thead><tbody><% items.forEach(row=>{ %><tr><td><a href="/admin/<%= kind %>/<%= row._id %>"><%= row.name || row.full_name %></a></td><td><%= row.email %><br><%= row.whatsapp %></td><td><%= parentName(row[course?'course_id':'webinar_id']) %></td><td><%= course?row.status:row.registration_status+' / '+row.payment_status %></td><td><%= new Date(row.createdAt).toLocaleDateString('en-IN') %></td></tr><% }) %></tbody></table></div><% if(!items.length){ %><p>No matching records.</p><% } %><div class="studio-actions"><% if(page>1){params.set('page',page-1); %><a href="?<%= params.toString() %>">Previous</a><% } %><% if(page*50<total){params.set('page',page+1); %><a href="?<%= params.toString() %>">Next</a><% } %></div><% } %></main></body></html>
